2 text-xs font-medium text-adopted-800">Photo captured. Click to view full size.</span></button><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="start-camera inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-rescue-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-rescue-700"><i data-lucide="camera" class="h-4 w-4"></i>Open camera</button><button type="button" class="switch-camera hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700"><i data-lucide="repeat-2" class="h-4 w-4"></i>Switch front/back</button><button type="button" class="capture-photo inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-adopted-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white disabled:opacity-50" disabled><i data-lucide="aperture" class="h-4 w-4"></i>Capture photo</button><button type="button" class="retake-photo hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-300 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800"><i data-lucide="refresh-cw" class="h-4 w-4"></i>Retake</button></div><p class="location-status mt-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">Open the camera, capture the photo, then allow location access.</p></article><?php endforeach ?></div></section>
